# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 4 ("Binding groups and cycles": the order of a group's lines decides positions and nothing else), ch. 8 (a widget application is transparent; `<-` binds its result) and ruling TC (places counted as built: the loud arm builds place 1, so the last label is 2; the soft arm builds none, so it is 1).
